@baseUrl = {{$processEnv API_BASE_URL}}
@userToken = {{$processEnv EASYTAB_USER_TOKEN}}
@otherRoleToken = {{$processEnv EASYTAB_OTHER_ROLE_TOKEN}}

### Korisnik: do tri preporuke s objašnjenjem
GET {{baseUrl}}/Locale/recommended
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Bez tokena: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/Locale/recommended

### Druga uloga: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/Locale/recommended
Authorization: Bearer {{otherRoleToken}}
